cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the member packages you use; each has its own CITATION.cff and Zenodo DOI (see README)."
type: software
title: "tacular-omics: Install the tacular-omics proteomics packages together"
abstract: >-
  tacular-omics is a meta-package that installs the tacular-omics core Python
  packages for mass-spectrometry proteomics (tacular, psimodpy, unimodpy,
  uniprotptmpy, fastatacular, pefftacular, mzmlpy, tdfpy, peptacular,
  paftacular and spxtacular) at a set of released versions tested together,
  each pinned with a floor and a major-version cap. It has no functionality of
  its own beyond reporting the installed member versions. It requires Python
  3.12 or later.
version: "0.1.0"
authors:
